","block_id":"6Wj8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c778a7d2-5cab-40cf-85f7-62ae4d7e6132","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあ実際のところ端末周りって歴史的事情が積み重なって 0 から全部再実装しようとすると死ぬほどつらいというのはわかるので、対応できないって割り切るのもわかるし、競合がなかなか出てこないのもまあそうだよねって感じなのよね","ts":"1618281480.289000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qag"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ae80476-d136-49fc-8a19-473e666f06d1","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"tmux 自体が、はたしかにそういうスタンスなんですかねぇ...","ts":"1618281014.287100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dwe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bed7a0ac-5b75-4f37-8409-dfa0a2cc8a82","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"もし気になるなら\n```if \u0026amp;term =~ \"screen\"```\nとか判定書いとけば動かないですかね","ts":"1618280918.286600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zMNz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9dbfbe72-b229-44c2-8612-72c7603d184b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"tmux は xterm 互換のエスケープは対応する気が一切ないってことですよね。やっぱりつらいなぁ","ts":"1618280913.286400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"61MOW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eacc607e-9299-413d-b539-b36385e282a6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"t_ のやつ設定するとちゃんとフルカラーになるので、 $TERM は screen-256color にしておいて Vim ではここを設定するのが最適解なのかな…","ts":"1618280868.285100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hVpzh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8e11390-70a9-4a1a-912d-81bc75acbff3","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/vimdoc-ja/term.html#xterm-true-color\u003e","ts":"1618280842.284500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/2iP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adb4066e-6234-439e-a8e7-24caf4b720fb","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、書いてた","ts":"1618280840.284200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cpRc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63b7bc3b-4e5c-4661-b01b-da5be15b7b66","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ちなみに semicolon のやつはデフォ値なはずなんですが、もしかしたら vim が中で xterm かを判定してるのかもです\n// ちゃんと追ってない","ts":"1618280811.283700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oyP7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5328633b-3e8f-4304-9f03-fb79e53108e3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"必要ですね","ts":"1618280646.282600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7YF2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45feed14-3a91-415d-a678-79240948007e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"// 自作カラースキーマ使ってて全部 gui color の設定しかしてないので色が消えたｗ","ts":"1618280630.282400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V6VOt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"608467e7-6360-4d85-a0a7-91508e53477b","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、やっぱ `t_8f` `t_8b` 必要ですね","ts":"1618280584.281900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"glA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f69dd76-3aab-41b0-aebe-2a82f1bfcf0c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`:terminal` だとグラデーションがカクカクになった (何も設定してない)","ts":"1618280467.281500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mlj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00c04c35-d801-4e8b-bc84-cc5d29724404","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim 内で確認するにはどうすればいいんだろ。 `:terminal` で確認してもよい?","ts":"1618280433.281100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S=T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fc3436d-1314-42e9-bc15-b6abe8c1347e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"たしかに `tmux-256color` で使うときに設定したものなので `screen-256color` でも必要かはちゃんと確かめてない...","ts":"1618280410.280500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kpvV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5bc50e56-e4c9-40c5-b10e-f0ee87acb187","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、もしかして `screen-256color` なら `t_8f` `t_8b` の設定不要でした?","ts":"1618280348.279400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QcoLv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"347ffd3d-a3d5-4051-ae71-f98ee1b06e10","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"わたしも綺麗にグラデーション出ますねー\n思い込んでるだけじゃなくてよかったｗ","ts":"1618280298.278700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kf="}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fd792da-0735-44ca-9b73-678cf7b67552","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"とりあえず端末上では上記の awk のやつできれいにグラデーションが出たので大丈夫そう","ts":"1618280185.278100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xde+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23f53527-8ea7-489a-ade3-8055b8f6266c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、そうだ特殊な設定してないは嘘でしたｗ\n```let \u0026amp;t_8f = \"\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;[38;2;%lu;%lu;%lum\"\nlet \u0026amp;t_8b = \"\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;[48;2;%lu;%lu;%lum\"```\nこれを vimrc に書いてます","ts":"1618280157.277600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tns"}]},{"client_msg_id":"849888b1-d51c-441b-89ac-6595726d42dd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://gist.github.com/XVilka/8346728\u003e 確認はこれかな","ts":"1618280090.276900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lTR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81c812a2-8f30-4da5-963b-ff608721cd20","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、`tmux-256color` って書いてるｗ\nちょっと試し打ちしただけなので、ここは `screen-256color` で...","ts":"1618280046.276500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"man-gesturing-ok","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ABEy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d43e6fa7-1a74-4f13-a54e-95977c205e03","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"フルカラーが出るかどうか確認するスニペットあったような","ts":"1618280034.276200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c3r9R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1869125-d079-467a-a488-66a18c0871e9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あれ、自分がフルカラーだと思い込んでるだけなのかなｗ","ts":"1618280006.275400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2fFfe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2325290a-d14e-463c-a08e-2ef9db789e0b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"パクらせていただこう :pray:","ts":"1618279998.275200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GUyJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ef8e5f8-f6c8-4f29-8f6f-e4cbdeb16b3c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"```set-option -g default-terminal \"tmux-256color\"\nset-option -ga terminal-overrides \",$TERM:Tc\"```\nこれで","ts":"1618279983.274600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SzRKk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f34e756-62d6-4b6b-9776-3c6a887bfe62","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私はターミナルマルチプレクサ使ってない","ts":"1618279981.274500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=bZqB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ac7e7a6-e018-4eb5-8293-d61534818f41","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"256 colorもフルカラー対応で出るのかな","ts":"1618279961.273900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Av7G"}]},{"clie