},{"client_msg_id":"39904dad-f854-4292-9f99-6050fd3dc5f2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"tmux ないと割と平和な気がしてきた…","ts":"1618278590.263200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fri2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8399b270-b437-46bb-9bab-56c30f90fa20","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、あと tmux が間にありますね…これ除いて試してみよう…","ts":"1618278541.262500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ll3P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d27662e9-d9f0-4ef5-9a64-67cb23638b0e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`xterm-256color` でした","ts":"1618278519.262000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LBzF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6738380c-a80f-4b5f-a3b8-ec5c8f63e2a4","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"そうならWindows Terminalの問題だろうか？ `$TERM` はどうしてますか？","ts":"1618278477.261700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AxLBm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41c03ac9-fbf4-4cb2-a0f1-559887f1e7fd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`vim.exe` ではなくパッケージインストールした `vim` (Unix版) です","ts":"1618278318.260900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vq4rJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3ad89bd-49db-45b1-98ca-e38b22b51aef","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"WSL2 内の Vim です","ts":"1618278292.260500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pgAAx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8201fa9d-5624-454d-ba9e-86a857a9b708","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"動かしてるVimはWin32版ですか？それともSSHとかでつないでUnix版ですか？","ts":"1618278053.260200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"71a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f1f2b1a-33b1-4074-8dca-f84203c0de62","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"無理矢理実装してたはずだから","ts":"1618277719.259200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"blgak"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0551ddc-b1ab-4088-bffd-8c50a0979ee1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そもそも垂直分割は崩れやすいはず","ts":"1618277709.259100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=6T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ac6813e-be98-4b98-9d41-ece3a1ff7d21","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"エスケープシーケンスはバッファ内にはないですね","ts":"1618277351.259000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MsUz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b33f377-42cd-4d9b-b044-65834927d3ff","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"良くあるのはエスケープシーケンスが混ざって崩れることかなぁ","ts":"1618277315.258700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nzb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fc7a171-58a5-46b5-8445-caf2f763b5ac","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"描画が崩れるにもいろいろあるからなぁ","ts":"1618277299.258600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"88Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6292f830-c5b1-40b0-adbb-177f73352a70","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"CUI の Vim、Vim のせいか端末のせいかがわからないんですけどかなり頻繁に描画が崩れませんか? (今使ってるターミナルは Windows Terminal)\n`\u0026lt;C-l\u0026gt;` を押すと大半は直るんですけど、直らない場合もあり…\n `EOF` 以降のエリアが特に崩れやすい印象があります。垂直分割して左に `EOF` エリアがあると、右側のバッファの一部が左側に描画されてしまったりする","ts":"1618277098.258500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dudT3"}]}]
